 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "In the corridor, Gulya claims that her mother found a groom for her at home and begs Lyova to forgive her. Later that evening, Nastya leaves Kostya and Denis at the apartment to attend Katya's bachelorette party.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "gulya",
   "t": "Лёва, это всё чистая правда.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Но как же теперь мы?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "gulya",
   "t": "Я скоро там выхожу замуж.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "gulya",
   "t": "Моя мама нашла мне жениха.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "gulya",
   "t": "У нас дома так принято.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "gulya",
   "t": "Прости меня, пожалуйста, за всё.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Я предложил ей сегодня уехать.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Да забудь ты про неё!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Сейчас Настя уйдёт из дома.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "И мы с тобой поговорим.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Всё, я побежала на девичник.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Вы тут много не пейте.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Now let's go back through their conversation line by line and unpack the Russian phrasing.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "gulya",
   "t": "Лёва, это всё чистая правда.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Lyova, this is all the pure truth.' Here the Russian phrasing highlights 'Lyova' before landing on 'really'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Но как же теперь мы?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'But what about us now?' The grammar packs 'but' and 'we' into a tight, idiomatic kitchen exchange.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "gulya",
   "t": "Я скоро там выхожу замуж.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I am getting married there soon.' Gulya anchors the line on 'I', while 'married' completes the thought.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "gulya",
   "t": "Моя мама нашла мне жениха.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'My mother found a groom for me.' Here the Russian phrasing highlights 'my' before landing on 'groom'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "gulya",
   "t": "У нас дома так принято.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'That is the custom for us at home.' The meaning hinges on 'at' working together with 'customary' in spoken Russian.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "gulya",
   "t": "Прости меня, пожалуйста, за всё.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Forgive me, please, for everything.' In Russian, the idea of 'forgive' flows naturally into 'everything' without extra filler words. Lyova answers right away.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Я предложил ей сегодня уехать.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I offered to run away with her today.' Lyova brings out the contrast between 'I' and 'suggested' in a few short words.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Да забудь ты про неё!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Just forget about her!' Notice how Russian expresses 'yes' and 'she' with crisp inflection rather than helper words.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Сейчас Настя уйдёт из дома.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Nastya will leave the house right now.' Here the Russian phrasing highlights 'now' before landing on 'at home'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "И мы с тобой поговорим.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And you and I will have a talk.' Lyova anchors the line on 'and', while 'talk' completes the thought.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Всё, я побежала на девичник.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'That is it, I am running off to the bachelorette party.' The grammar packs 'everything' and 'bachelorette party' into a tight, idiomatic kitchen exchange.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Вы тут много не пейте.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
